# Build outputs. scripts/build-termux.sh and scripts/build-termux-prebuilt.sh both write a
# throwaway npm tree into ./build and the packed tarball into ./dist. Neither is source: the
# release workflow uploads dist/* as a build artifact and publishes the tarball itself, so keeping
# them out of the repository avoids committing a ~150 MB binary and a 600 MB dependency tree.
build/
dist/
node_modules/
